[[- define "entry-format" -]]
Put the entry between <text> and </text>, laid out like this, with no code fence and nothing else inside the tags:

<text>
Title: a short title
Keys: keys, separated by commas
[[- if .]]
Secondary keys: keys, separated by commas
Constant: yes or no
[[- end]]

The content.
</text>
[[- end]]
